  "description": "YIGJEE crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 O12 Sm4. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1B (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1A (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1C (Sm) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.689-3.689 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.52-106.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132O12Sm4.",
